    [9527]={name="Spellshifter Rod",quality=3,ilvl=48,reqLevel=40,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Tiara of the Deep'. Starts with Tabetha in Dustwallow Marsh. Objective: Bring the Tiara of the Deep to Tabetha in Dustwallow Marsh.",zone="Zul'Farrak",questName="Tiara of the Deep",lore="Long ago I possessed a beautiful piece of jewelry, the Tiara of the Deep. And not only was it pretty--it held great power for those with the knowledge to use it."},
    [9536]={name="Fairywing Mantle",quality=3,ilvl=32,reqLevel=20,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'A Fine Mess'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Kernobee in Stranglethorn Vale. Objective: Escort Kernobee to the Clockwerk Run exit and then report to Scooty in Booty Bay.",zone="Gnomeregan",questName="A Fine Mess",lore="Wha.. What happened? The last thing I remember is being captured by a group of dark iron dwarves, beaten to within an inch of my life and then thrown in here with these filthy troggs."},
    [9538]={name="Talvash's Gold Ring",quality=3,ilvl=37,reqLevel=28,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Gnome Improvement'.",zone="Ironforge",questName="Gnome Improvement",lore="Listen, that ring is yours, sure..."},
    [9600]={name="Lace Pants",quality=1,ilvl=12,reqLevel=5,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Sathrah's Sacrifice'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Priestess A'moora in Darnassus. Objective: Priestess A'moora wants you to place Lady Sathrah's silvery spinnerets at the fountain inside the temple, and then return to her.",zone="Darnassus",questName="Sathrah's Sacrifice",lore="Now you must finish the task to which you have been appointed. Take the spinnerets and offer Lady Sathrah's sacrifice to Elune; lay the great spider to rest."},
    [9603]={name="Gritroot Staff",quality=2,ilvl=10,reqLevel=4,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Relics of Wakening'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Athridas Bearmantle in Teldrassil. Objective: Retrieve the Relics of Wakening and bring them to Athridas Bearmantle in Dolanaar.",zone="Teldrassil",questName="The Relics of Wakening",lore="Gnarlpine invaders were seen ravaging the Ban'ethil Barrow Den to the west. The slumbering druids will be trapped in the Emerald Dream for eternity, unaware of their fate, unless we help."},
    [9605]={name="Repairman's Cape",quality=3,ilvl=32,reqLevel=25,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Data Rescue'. Starts with Master Mechanic Castpipe in Ironforge. Objective: Bring a Prismatic Punch Card to Master Mechanic Castpipe in Ironforge.",zone="Gnomeregan",questName="Data Rescue",lore="When we fled Gnomeregan, we left so much data behind! Vitally important data! I need the data on a prismatic punch card, from a Matrix Punchograph 3005-D high security terminal, deep in Gnomeregan."},
    [9609]={name="Shilly Mitts",quality=2,ilvl=32,reqLevel=20,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Gyrodrillmatic Excavationators'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Shoni the Shilent in Stormwind City. Objective: Bring twenty-four Robo-mechanical Guts to Shoni in Stormwind.",zone="Gnomeregan",questName="Gyrodrillmatic Excavationators",lore="It's terrible. We are not going to have enough parts to get our fleet of gyrodrillmatic excavationators to Dun Morogh. What we need are spare parts."},
    [9623]={name="Civinad Robes",quality=3,ilvl=37,reqLevel=25,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Rig Wars'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Nogg in Orgrimmar. Objective: Retrieve the Rig Blueprints and Thermaplugg's Safe Combination from Gnomeregan and bring them to Nogg in Orgrimmar.",zone="Gnomeregan",questName="Rig Wars",lore="Gnome technology - two years ago its most common use was as a punch line. Times certainly have changed. Now they've got a new rig built that's better than all our shredder models combined."},
    [9634]={name="Skilled Handling Gloves",quality=2,ilvl=46,reqLevel=38,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Return to Apothecary Zinge'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Chief Engineer Bilgewhizzle in Undercity. Objective: Bring the Sealed Field Testing Kit to Apothecary Zinge in the Undercity.",zone="Undercity",questName="Return to Apothecary Zinge",lore="\"Here you go, the power source is safely removed and the data is preserved. Well, safe journeys and all that."},
    [9635]={name="Master Apothecary Cape",quality=2,ilvl=45,reqLevel=38,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Return to Apothecary Zinge'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Chief Engineer Bilgewhizzle in Undercity. Objective: Bring the Sealed Field Testing Kit to Apothecary Zinge in the Undercity.",zone="Undercity",questName="Return to Apothecary Zinge",lore="You secure the sealed testing kit for the journey back to the Undercity. Apothecary Zinge waits for you and the sealed field testing kit there."},
    [9644]={name="Thermotastic Egg Timer",quality=2,ilvl=51,reqLevel=43,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Rescue OOX-17/TN!'. Pick it over the other reward choices.",zone="Tanaris",questName="Rescue OOX-17/TN!",lore="The gnome's voice crackles once again from the robot: \"I need to move OOX-17/TN to an open, safe place so it can begin a lengthy take-off procedure."},
    [9645]={name="Gnomish Inventor Boots",quality=2,ilvl=49,reqLevel=43,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Rescue OOX-09/HL!'. Pick it over the other reward choices.",zone="The Hinterlands",questName="Rescue OOX-09/HL!",lore="The gnome's voice crackles once again from the robot: \"I need to move OOX-09/HL to an open, safe place so it can begin a lengthy take-off procedure."},
    [9648]={name="Chainlink Towel",quality=2,ilvl=48,reqLevel=40,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Rescue OOX-22/FE!'. Pick it over the other reward choices.",zone="Feralas",questName="Rescue OOX-22/FE!",lore="The gnome's voice crackles once again from the robot: \"I need to move OOX-22/FE to an open, safe place so it can begin a lengthy take-off procedure."},
    [9649]={name="Royal Highmark Vestments",quality=2,ilvl=55,reqLevel=40,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Venom to the Undercity'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Apothecary Lydon. Objective: Bring Faranell's Parcel to Master Apothecary Faranell in the Undercity.",zone="The Hinterlands",questName="Venom to the Undercity",lore="The venom you gathered from the Witherbark's spider god is quite a find! I've been able to kill nearly two dozen rabbits with just a drop of the stuff."},
    [9654]={name="Cairnstone Sliver",quality=2,ilvl=50,reqLevel=42,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Morrow Stone'. Pick it over the other reward choices. The quest is in Feralas. Objective: Return the Sparkling Stone and the Stave of Equinex to Troyas Moonbreeze in Feathermoon Stronghold.",zone="Feralas",questName="The Morrow Stone",lore="The moment the artifact is removed from the Monolith, you feel the energy in the Stave of Equinex begin to fade."},
    [9655]={name="Seedtime Hoop",quality=2,ilvl=50,reqLevel=42,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Morrow Stone'. Pick it over the other reward choices. The quest is in Feralas. Objective: Return the Sparkling Stone and the Stave of Equinex to Troyas Moonbreeze in Feathermoon Stronghold.",zone="Feralas",questName="The Morrow Stone",lore="The moment the artifact is removed from the Monolith, you feel the energy in the Stave of Equinex begin to fade."},
    [9658]={name="Boots of the Maharishi",quality=2,ilvl=43,reqLevel=38,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Gordunni Cobalt'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Orwin Gizzmick in Feralas. Objective: Orwin Gizzmick in Camp Mojache wants 12 samples of Gordunni Cobalt.",zone="Feralas",questName="Gordunni Cobalt",lore="I just arrived here in Feralas, and I've heard that the Gordunni Ogres that inhabit the wilds here have some interesting minerals. Who knows what they are up to, but they sure are protective of that stuff!"},
    [9660]={name="Stargazer Cloak",quality=2,ilvl=43,reqLevel=38,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Gordunni Cobalt'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Orwin Gizzmick in Feralas. Objective: Orwin Gizzmick in Camp Mojache wants 12 samples of Gordunni Cobalt.",zone="Feralas",questName="Gordunni Cobalt",lore="I just arrived here in Feralas, and I've heard that the Gordunni Ogres that inhabit the wilds here have some interesting minerals. Who knows what they are up to, but they sure are protective of that stuff!"},
    [9665]={name="Wingcrest Gloves",quality=2,ilvl=50,reqLevel=45,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Dark Heart'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Talo Thornhoof in Feralas. Objective: Talo Thornhoof in Camp Mojache wants Edana Hatetalon's Dark Heart.",zone="Feralas",questName="Dark Heart",lore="Edana Hatetalon is the queen of the Northspring harpies that reside in the ruins to the west. She is pure evil; I have heard that her heart is one of crystal."},
    [9683]={name="Strength of the Treant",quality=2,ilvl=50,reqLevel=40,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Weapons of Spirit'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Witch Doctor Uzer'i in Feralas. Objective: Witch Doctor Uzer'i wants you to wait for a moment while he prepares the weapons.",zone="Feralas",questName="Weapons of Spirit",lore="Imbuing the muisek into the weapons is a difficult process. Now that I have all of the required materials and the muisek of the creatures that you captured, I may begin."},
