    [15204]={name="Moonstone Wand",quality=2,ilvl=18,reqLevel=15,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Blackwood Corrupted'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Thundris Windweaver in Darkshore. Objective: Fill the Empty Cleansing Bowl at the Auberdine Moonwell.Gather a sample of fruit, nut, and grain from the northern Blackwood furbolg camps.Mix the bowl and place it near the bonfire closest to the Cliffspring River at the northern camp, thus summoning the satyr corruptor.Take the Talisman of Corruption and bring it to Thundris Windweaver in Auberdine.",zone="Darkshore",questName="The Blackwood Corrupted",lore="We've learned that a source of furbolg corruption is from the satyr. They hold sway via talismans that they channel magic through. If the furbolg have a chance at salvation, we must lure out the satyr corruptor and take that talisman!"},
    [15206]={name="Jadefinger Baton",quality=2,ilvl=20,reqLevel=17,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Sleeper Has Awakened'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Kerlonian Evershade in Darkshore. Objective: Escort Kerlonian Evershade to Liladris Moonriver south along the road to find his bag in Darkshore.",zone="Darkshore",questName="The Sleeper Has Awakened",lore="I was on my way to Maestra's Post to meet Liladris Moonriver, but I decided to stop here and take a short nap. Ever since I awoke from the emerald dream, I have been so sleepy..."},
    [15281]={name="Glowstar Rod",quality=2,ilvl=57,reqLevel=52,sourceType="world_drop",instructions="World drop around level 38-61.",zone="Eastern Plaguelands"},
    [15283]={name="Lunar Wand",quality=2,ilvl=64,reqLevel=59,sourceType="world_drop",instructions="World drop around level 55-73."},
    [15309]={name="Feral Cloak",quality=2,ilvl=15,reqLevel=10,sourceType="world_drop",instructions="World drop around level 11-16."},
    [15333]={name="Wrangler's Cloak",quality=2,ilvl=22,reqLevel=17,sourceType="world_drop",instructions="World drop around level 17-24."},
    [15397]={name="Oakthrush Staff",quality=2,ilvl=14,reqLevel=12,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Fragments Within'. Pick it over the other reward choices. The quest is in Darkshore. Objective: Report back what you have found to Sentinel Glynda Nal'Shea in Auberdine.",zone="Darkshore",questName="The Fragments Within",lore="The moonwell water has revealed that embedded inside the crystal are a few small fragments of bone, as well as half of a jawbone."},
    [15398]={name="Sandcomber Boots",quality=1,ilvl=14,reqLevel=11,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Washed Ashore'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Gwennyth Bly'Leggonde in Darkshore. Objective: Recover the Sea Turtle Remains from the Skeletal Sea Turtle in the waters west of Auberdine, and then speak with Gwennyth Bly'Leggonde back in Auberdine.",zone="Darkshore",questName="Washed Ashore",lore="That beached creature is not an isolated incident here in Darkshore. There are more along the coastline and even in the water."},
    [15401]={name="Welldrip Gloves",quality=1,ilvl=14,reqLevel=13,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Deep Ocean, Vast Sea'. Pick it over the other reward choices.",zone="Darkshore",questName="Deep Ocean, Vast Sea",lore="Off the coast of Darkshore to our north are two wrecked ships - the Silver Dawning and the Mist Veil. Some time ago, both ships ran afoul of the blasted murlocs as they sailed across the vast sea into Auberdine."},
    [15443]={name="Kris of Orgrimmar",quality=2,ilvl=18,reqLevel=9,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Hidden Enemies'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Thrall in Ragefire Chasm. Objective: Kill Bazzalan and Jergosh the Invoker before returning to Thrall in Orgrimmar.",zone="Orgrimmar",questName="Hidden Enemies",lore="You are one of my lieutenants! Prepare yourself. I will call upon you soon. My time spent on the Searing Blade may be all but wasted now, but that does not mean that the Shadow Council's schemes elsewhere must suffer."},
    [15444]={name="Staff of Orgrimmar",quality=2,ilvl=18,reqLevel=9,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Hidden Enemies'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Thrall in Ragefire Chasm. Objective: Kill Bazzalan and Jergosh the Invoker before returning to Thrall in Orgrimmar.",zone="Orgrimmar",questName="Hidden Enemies",lore="You are one of my lieutenants! Prepare yourself. I will call upon you soon. My time spent on the Searing Blade may be all but wasted now, but that does not mean that the Shadow Council's schemes elsewhere must suffer."},
    [15449]={name="Ghastly Trousers",quality=3,ilvl=18,reqLevel=9,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Power to Destroy...'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Varimathras in Undercity. Objective: Bring the books Spells of Shadow and Incantations from the Nether to Varimathras in Undercity.",zone="Ragefire Chasm",questName="The Power to Destroy...",lore="Many denizens of the Legion bestow gifts on their followers as you may well know. Some of these gifts the Dark Lady feels would be better off in her hands than in the hands of those with..."},
    [15452]={name="Featherbead Bracers",quality=2,ilvl=18,reqLevel=9,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Returning the Lost Satchel'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Maur Grimtotem in Thunder Bluff. Objective: Take the Grimtotem Satchel to Rahauro in Thunder Bluff.",zone="Ragefire Chasm",questName="Returning the Lost Satchel",lore="You find a satchel under the body of the tauren. It is still gripped tightly in his arms as though he was trying to protect it while being attacked by the troggs."},
    [15455]={name="Dustfall Robes",quality=2,ilvl=37,reqLevel=30,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Hints of a New Plague?'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Quae in Hillsbrad Foothills. Objective: Find Phin Odelic in Southshore.",zone="Hillsbrad Foothills",questName="Hints of a New Plague?",lore="I've seen Kinelory look way worse after a night in the tavern than she does now. You obviously did a good job protecting her."},
    [15457]={name="Desert Shoulders",quality=2,ilvl=28,reqLevel=24,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Grimtotem Spying'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Cliffwatcher Longhorn in Thousand Needles. Objective: Locate and retrieve the three Secret Notes in Darkcloud Pinnacle.",zone="Thousand Needles",questName="Grimtotem Spying",lore="you have served us well in the past, so I now entrust to you an important mission. The Grimtotem Clan is up to something secretive. Three agents of unknown origin were seen visiting the Grimtotem over the recent weeks."},
    [15461]={name="Lightheel Boots",quality=2,ilvl=25,reqLevel=23,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Protect Kanati Greycloud'. Pick it over the other reward choices. The quest is in Thousand Needles. Objective: Protect Kanati Greycloud from the centaur attack.",zone="Thousand Needles",questName="Protect Kanati Greycloud",lore="But, there may be more centaur than I thought, I ask you, to fight with me against these vile assassins."},
    [15465]={name="Stingshot Wand",quality=2,ilvl=28,reqLevel=24,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Arikara'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Magatha Grimtotem in Thousand Needles. Objective: Slay Arikara. Bring her remains and the Incendia powder to Motega Firemane in Whitereach Post as proof of your deed.",zone="Thousand Needles",questName="Arikara",lore="Take this refined and purified Incendia powder to Thousand Needles and toss it on the sacred fire of life. It is located in the Darkcloud Pinnacle on an isolated needle where they bury their dead."},
    [15468]={name="Windsong Drape",quality=2,ilvl=29,reqLevel=25,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Free at Last'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Lakota Windsong in Thousand Needles. Objective: Escort Lakota Windsong from the Darkcloud Pinnacle, and then talk to Thalia Amberhide at Freewind Post.",zone="Thousand Needles",questName="Free at Last",lore="Arnak thinks we're going to be married... but after I declined his offer he came back that night and kidnapped me. My brother tried to stop him, but Arnak was too strong."},
    [15501]={name="Outrunner's Cloak",quality=2,ilvl=17,reqLevel=12,sourceType="world_drop",instructions="World drop around level 11-18."},
    [15508]={name="Grunt's Cape",quality=2,ilvl=19,reqLevel=14,sourceType="world_drop",instructions="World drop around level 14-20."},
    [15519]={name="Spiked Chain Cloak",quality=2,ilvl=23,reqLevel=18,sourceType="world_drop",instructions="World drop around level 18-24."},
    [15526]={name="Sentry's Cape",quality=2,ilvl=24,reqLevel=19,sourceType="world_drop",instructions="World drop around level 19-26."},
    [15559]={name="Pillager's Cloak",quality=2,ilvl=31,reqLevel=26,sourceType="world_drop",instructions="World drop around level 26-32.",zone="Tirisfal Glades",zoneOpen=true},
    [15594]={name="Steadfast Cloak",quality=2,ilvl=37,reqLevel=32,sourceType="world_drop",instructions="World drop around level 32-39."},
    [15661]={name="Impenetrable Cloak",quality=2,ilvl=54,reqLevel=49,sourceType="world_drop",instructions="World drop around level 48-55."},
    [15690]={name="Kodobone Necklace",quality=2,ilvl=41,reqLevel=33,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Bone Collector'.",zone="Desolace",questName="Bone Collector",lore="We're sitting on a goldmine here, I tell you - a goldmine! Kodo bones will change the world forever... I have customers making furniture, music instruments, and even blasting powder out of them."},
    [15692]={name="Kodo Brander",quality=2,ilvl=38,reqLevel=32,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Gizelton Caravan'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Rigger Gizelton in Desolace. Objective: Escort the Gizelton Caravan through Mannoroc Coven. Talk with Smeed at Scrabblescrew's Camp for your reward.",zone="Desolace",questName="Gizelton Caravan",lore="You look like a capable. Perhaps you're looking to make some money? Cork and I started this caravan to make a bundle of money; little did we know the dangers of turning a buck!"},
    [15697]={name="Kodo Rustler Boots",quality=2,ilvl=38,reqLevel=30,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Kodo Roundup'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Smeed Scrabblescrew in Desolace. Objective: Bring five Tamed Kodos and the Kodo Kombobulator back to Smeed Scrabblescrew at Scrabblescrew's Camp.",zone="Desolace",questName="Kodo Roundup",lore="Well, the only caravan brave enough to travel these parts relies on me. Ever since I learned how to rejuvenate and control aged and dying kodos with my kodo kombobulator, the caravan owner Cork, Rigger, and I entered a partnership."},
    [15702]={name="Chemist's Ring",quality=2,ilvl=55,reqLevel=48,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Melding of Influences'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Chemist Fuely in Undercity. Objective: Bring a Merged Ooze Sample to Chemist Fuely in Undercity.",zone="Undercity",questName="Melding of Influences",lore="Here is some encased ooze created from the Felwood samples you recovered. Take the case to Un'Goro Crater and find a pure ooze... the primal variety will do nicely."},
    [15707]={name="Brantwood Sash",quality=2,ilvl=58,reqLevel=48,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'A Final Blow'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Greta Mosshoof in Felwood. Objective: Kill Moora and Salia, and bring Shadow Lord Fel'dan's Head to Greta Mosshoof in Felwood.",zone="Felwood",questName="A Final Blow",lore="Unfortunately, I see the only way to stop this threat to Felwood is a frontal attack. There are no other ways into Shadow Hold, and I have no means to teleport you inside."},
    [15784]={name="Crystal Breeze Mantle",quality=2,ilvl=59,reqLevel=52,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'High Chief Winterfall'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Donova Snowden in Winterspring. Objective: Donova Snowden in Winterspring wants you to defeat High Chief Winterfall.",zone="Winterspring",questName="High Chief Winterfall",lore="While we still know very little about why the furbolg have been ingesting this strange substance, I do think it's best that we put a stop to it before it gets out of hand."},
    [15791]={name="Turquoise Sash",quality=2,ilvl=58,reqLevel=53,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Crystal of Zin-Malor'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Wynd Nightchaser in Darnassus. Objective: Deliver the Crystal of Zin-Malor to Arch Druid Fandral Staghelm in Darnassus.",zone="Winterspring",questName="The Crystal of Zin-Malor",lore="Quite impressive. The crystal of Zin-Malor can never be returned to the temple which, as you know, lies in ruin. But I believe that your effort to undo the evil of the past should not go unrewarded."},
    [15799]={name="Heroic Commendation Medal",quality=2,ilvl=58,reqLevel=50,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Mission Accomplished!'. Starts with High Executor Derrington in Tirisfal Glades. Objective: &lt;name&gt;, your successful re-engineering of the cauldrons is a tremendous victory for us!Let all within my presence hear: for service to the Forsaken and to the Horde as a whole above and beyond what was expected - in the face of overwhelming odds and incredible danger, might I add - I give &lt;name&gt; this, and I extend upon him our undying gratitude as a true hero of the Horde. &nbsp;Huzzah!",zone="Western Plaguelands",questName="Mission Accomplished!"},
    [15802]={name="Mooncloth Boots",quality=3,ilvl=56,reqLevel=51,sourceType="profession",instructions="Crafted with Tailoring (requires skill 1).",profession="Tailoring"},
    [15804]={name="Cerise Drape",quality=2,ilvl=56,reqLevel=51,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Glyphed Oaken Branch'. Starts with Mulgris Deepriver in Darnassus. Objective: Based on the magic enchanted within the Glyphed Oaken Branch, its delivery to the Cenarion Circle in Darnassus is the next step the tauren druid sought. Seek one of the druids there for assistance.",zone="Western Plaguelands",questName="Glyphed Oaken Branch",lore="The lifeless hand of the tauren druid clutches a surprisingly healthy looking oaken branch. Examining the branch reveals glyphs of a druidic nature carved into the bark."},
    [15812]={name="Orchid Amice",quality=2,ilvl=56,reqLevel=53,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'A Matter of Time'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Chromie in Western Plaguelands. Objective: Use the Temporal Displacer near one of Andorhal's silos and uncover Temporal Parasites.Slay 15 Temporal Parasites, and then return the Temporal Displacer to Chromie in the Andorhal Inn, Western Plaguelands.",zone="Western Plaguelands",questName="A Matter of Time",lore="Tampering of the timeline by a sinister force - most likely the Scourge - has occurred in Andorhal! I can try to keep the passage of time here intact and mend what has been damaged, but I'll need your help to do so uninterrupted."},
    [15824]={name="Astoria Robes",quality=2,ilvl=59,reqLevel=55,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Put Her Down'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Helendis Riverhorn in Blackrock Spire. Objective: Travel to Blackrock Spire and destroy the source of the worg menace. As you left Helendis, he shouted a name: Halycon. It is what the orcs refer to in regards to the worg.",zone="Blackrock Spire",questName="Put Her Down",lore="You have no doubt seen the worgs which the Blackrock orcs command. It is curious - no matter how many we destroy, their numbers never dwindle."},
    [15856]={name="Archlight Talisman",quality=3,ilvl=60,reqLevel=50,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Hidden Treasures'. Starts with Pamela Redpath in Eastern Plaguelands. Objective: Bring Joseph's Key to Joseph's Chest.",zone="Eastern Plaguelands",questName="Hidden Treasures",lore="Daddy told me to give you this key. He said it opens a chest out back behind the house. He also wanted me to thank you. Did you do a favor for him?"},
    [15863]={name="Grave Scepter",quality=2,ilvl=54,reqLevel=50,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Return to Tinkee'. Pick it over the other reward choices.",zone="Winterspring",questName="Return to Tinkee",lore="Ok, everything is prepared and packed and ready for transport! Good luck in your journey, and make sure you tell Tinkee that she owes me!"},
    [15864]={name="Condor Bracers",quality=2,ilvl=39,reqLevel=34,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Ghost-o-plasm Round Up'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Hornizz Brimbuzzle in Desolace. Objective: Bring 8 Ghost-o-plasms and the Crate of Ghost Magnets to Hornizz Brimbuzzle in Desolace.",zone="Desolace",questName="Ghost-o-plasm Round Up",lore="There's a valley to the southeast, the Valley of Bones, haunted by Magram ghosts. Sounds scary, doesn't it? Well think how scary it is to the Magram!"},
